# grid[y * width + x] with three integers under 4096: the index is a 32-bit multiplication and a 32-bit addition. It is never negative, so it is extended with zeros once, for the bounds and for the address.
# CHECK-LABEL: name="at" role=Source
# CHECK-NOT: IToD
# CHECK: Int32 b@[[row]] = Mul(b@{{*}}, b@{{*}}, {{*}}:Mul)
# CHECK-NEXT: Int32 b@[[index]] = Add(b@{{*}}, b@[[row]], {{*}}:Add)
# CHECK-NEXT: Int64 b@[[wide]] = ZExt32(b@[[index]], {{*}}:IsInsideView)
# CHECK-NOT: IToD
# CHECK: Int32 b@{{*}} = Above(b@{{*}}, b@[[wide]], {{*}}:IsInsideView)
# CHECK-NOT: IToD
# CHECK: Int64 b@[[offset]] = Shl(b@[[wide]], $3(b@{{*}}), {{*}}:GetTypedArrayElement)
# CHECK: Double b@{{*}} = Load(b@{{*}}, ControlDependent|Reads:TypedArrayElements, {{*}}:GetTypedArrayElement)
# CHECK-LABEL: end of function
# Up to the load nothing becomes a double. Nowhere is the index tested for overflow or extended with its sign.
# NONE-LABEL: name="at" role=Source
# NONE-NOT: CheckMul
# NONE-NOT: CheckAdd
# NONE-NOT: SExt32
# NONE-LABEL: end of function
